{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings","id":1146909,"title":"Demons and Awakenings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-04T22:19:32-07:00","id":1146909,"title":"Demons and Awakenings?","content":"What rules should I create for a Demon/Mage crossover in regards to Awakening? Apparently Demons have the ability to guide humans to Awaken their full potential as they did during Babylon. If a Demon found a group of Hermetic Zealators who were bitter because they knew they would never wake up, how might a Demon proceed? Or is this like birthing Nepheliem where you just can't do that kind of thing anymore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T11:03:32-07:00","id":1147127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings#post1146909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <b>Or is this like birthing Nepheliem where you just can't do that kind of thing anymore?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>It's totally like this, and more.<br /> <br /> The Babel Tower was the supreme experiment ordered by Lucifer, and enacted with the help of at least one Archduke whose name I don't remember, to win the war against GOD. It Involved the creation of Nephilim, among other things.<br /> <br /> When Lucifer destroyed the Nephilim, he also destroyed the experiment. The human soul and faith on Demons were hurt so badly than this caused their defeat at the hands of the Loyal angels. We don't even know if humans can ever be returned to that enlightened state (albeit if Mages are remanents of this experiments, it may be doable).<br /> <br /> Since this experiment was the main hope of Lucifer, and his ultimate downfall; reenacting it, even at small scale, would be really big. As big as Faustians hope of constructing a faith based weapon that can break heaven's door. Big as in Lucifer being interested in your results, after all, HE was unable to just restart the whole thing before the imprisonment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T11:15:52-07:00","id":1147137,"title":"","content":"I personally allow 5 successes on a wp roll for Revelation (or whatever Radiance 5 is called. Been a while) to prompt an awakening. But, you can't augment the roll with Exalt. Spend some time with the humans, building up their strength of will then finally giving them that push that forces them to become something greater than they had been. I likewise allow 5 successes for someone who had already awakened to increase Arete.<br /> <br /> Other than that, just social engineering and trying to reinforce certain mindsets. Sort of like the Order of Hermes already does. For the most part, I think the babel project stuff was probably teaching magic more along the lines of Sorcery (exploiting the natural aspects of reality) than True Magic (straight up reality warping that Mages do). Not like the fallen had any idea what humanity could do besides &quot;Be like God. Yes.&quot; So they were mostly flailing blindly in the dark just teaching them things they knew. Which would fall under sorcery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 10-05-2017, 02:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T11:24:37-07:00","id":1147143,"title":"","content":"Also, it's still perfectly possible to create Nephilim. Just need a stone of fecundity. Zipacna (she made the stones in the first place) is out of the pit! Get started on Nephilim 2.0!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4017,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","user":"angryicecream","date":". 10-05-2017, 02:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T11:30:19-07:00","id":1147147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147143#post1147143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, it's still perfectly possible to create Nephilim. Just need a stone of fecundity. Zipacna (she made the stones in the first place) is out of the pit! Get started on Nephilim 2.0!</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure it's been tried before several times and the results are always still born.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T11:57:38-07:00","id":1147157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147147#post1147147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty sure it's been tried before several times and the results are always still born.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nah. They just don't have the stones (heh). Find a stone/make more produce more nephilim. Just generally fucking humans without one doesn't do anything. It makes a point of saying Zip is at large and people might pursue her to make more. Of course, white wolf being white wolf, you may indeed have seen the stillborn thing. They do so love to contradict themselves. Especially in Demon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T12:00:26-07:00","id":1147159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147137#post1147137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally allow 5 successes on a wp roll for Revelation (or whatever Radiance 5 is called. Been a while) to prompt an awakening. But, you can't augment the roll with Exalt. Spend some time with the humans, building up their strength of will then finally giving them that push that forces them to become something greater than they had been. I likewise allow 5 successes for someone who had already awakened to increase Arete.<br /> <br /> Other than that, just social engineering and trying to reinforce certain mindsets. Sort of like the Order of Hermes already does.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's something to be said in favor of &quot;influencing&quot; Awakening rather than forcing it. In Mage, forcing an Awakening it's Spirit 9, it's kind of a big deal because no one can do that. However one can create awakening inducing Grimoires with Mind 5 and having Arete 6. Savvy Demons should be able to do the same.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't allow to do it only with Radiance because it's something big-If Radiance allowed to create mages I think the books should say so-but a ritual with Radiance and perhaps Spirit and Celestial could be capable of creating an &quot;infernal grimoire&quot; or equivalent, albeit these have the potential to fail if the person isn't already near Awakening.<br /> <br /> Otherwise mages wouldn't be so rare :P .<br /> <br /> And increasing Arete should cost experience. Also, mere Mind 5 Grimoires can't increase Arete past 5 and neither should Demons (at least not below Archduke, Lores at 6 or such plot device things).<br /> <br /> Perhaps with a Pact these limitations can be overcomed since pacts work directly transmuting the soul of the mage and are limmited by faith potential (presumably impeding abuse?). Also pacts have other &quot;costs&quot; for the mage. Still this shouldn't allow for easy Awakening, mages sohuldn't be easy to come by. Perhaps you could limit this &quot;forced Awakening&quot; to people with Faith potential 5, and allow mages to gain Arete or Spheres by spending an amount of Faith Potential equal to the desired level (similar as with teaching Lores)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 10-05-2017, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T21:21:48-07:00","id":1147315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147159#post1147159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's something to be said in favor of &amp;quot;influencing&amp;quot; Awakening rather than forcing it. In Mage, forcing an Awakening it's Spirit 9, it's kind of a big deal because no one can do that. However one can create awakening inducing Grimoires with Mind 5 and having Arete 6. Savvy Demons should be able to do the same.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't allow to do it only with Radiance because it's something big-If Radiance allowed to create mages I think the books should say so-but a ritual with Radiance and perhaps Spirit and Celestial could be capable of creating an &amp;quot;infernal grimoire&amp;quot; or equivalent, albeit these have the potential to fail if the person isn't already near Awakening.<br /> <br /> Otherwise mages wouldn't be so rare :P .<br /> <br /> And increasing Arete should cost experience. Also, mere Mind 5 Grimoires can't increase Arete past 5 and neither should Demons (at least not below Archduke, Lores at 6 or such plot device things).<br /> <br /> Perhaps with a Pact these limitations can be overcomed since pacts work directly transmuting the soul of the mage and are limmited by faith potential (presumably impeding abuse?). Also pacts have other &amp;quot;costs&amp;quot; for the mage. Still this shouldn't allow for easy Awakening, mages sohuldn't be easy to come by. Perhaps you could limit this &amp;quot;forced Awakening&amp;quot; to people with Faith potential 5, and allow mages to gain Arete or Spheres by spending an amount of Faith Potential equal to the desired level (similar as with teaching Lores)</div> </div> </div> </div>I like all of the ideas presented here. Another option involves using sorcerers. They are supposed to be half Awakened and more capable of Awakening than ordinary humans. I suspect that one who has a strong mind and an iron will and who has extensive sorcerous abilities might be find his chances of Awakening increased through regular invocations of the Level 5 Lore of Radiance ability where 6+ successes are constantly rolled each time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T13:04:39-07:00","id":1147547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147159#post1147159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's something to be said in favor of &quot;influencing&quot; Awakening rather than forcing it. In Mage, forcing an Awakening it's Spirit 9, it's kind of a big deal because no one can do that. However one can create awakening inducing Grimoires with Mind 5 and having Arete 6. Savvy Demons should be able to do the same.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't allow to do it only with Radiance because it's something big-If Radiance allowed to create mages I think the books should say so-but a ritual with Radiance and perhaps Spirit and Celestial could be capable of creating an &quot;infernal grimoire&quot; or equivalent, albeit these have the potential to fail if the person isn't already near Awakening.<br /> <br /> Otherwise mages wouldn't be so rare :P .</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I think there was a misunderstanding. When I said 5 successes on Radiance 5 I meant 5 successes on the part of the human. Basically, <b>they</b> have to reach so far into themselves and come out on top. The demon can't help them along with anything other than giving them a chance. Radiance 5 can only be used once every few years so you really can't just farm mages with it especially if you disallow Exalt to give them more dice for the wp roll. So, basically only wp 8+ people are going to even have a shot at it. So not really forcing the awakening. Just handing them the opportunity. And if they fail they could lose WP dots and or go completely insane. So, think it's rather fair, personally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T22:50:11-07:00","id":1147676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147315#post1147315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like all of the ideas presented here. Another option involves using sorcerers. They are supposed to be half Awakened and more capable of Awakening than ordinary humans. I suspect that one who has a strong mind and an iron will and who has extensive sorcerous abilities might be find his chances of Awakening increased through regular invocations of the Level 5 Lore of Radiance ability where 6+ successes are constantly rolled each time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Depends on the book, honestly there's alot of ones that say sorcerers are LESS likely to awaken than average persons thus why most characters don't start as such.<br /> <br /> Ultimately though Awakening is about leading the Horse to water. That's what your actions do, whether its training as a hermetic, or offering up a book that pushes people in that direction. Its ultimately up to the potential mage to Drink. I'd put the roll on the potential mage's end and make it more difficult the more times its tried. So your failed Hermetics would already be down some having failed once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T23:10:21-07:00","id":1147682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147547#post1147547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, I think there was a misunderstanding. When I said 5 successes on Radiance 5 I meant 5 successes on the part of the human. Basically, <b>they</b> have to reach so far into themselves and come out on top. The demon can't help them along with anything other than giving them a chance. Radiance 5 can only be used once every few years so you really can't just farm mages with it especially if you disallow Exalt to give them more dice for the wp roll. So, basically only wp 8+ people are going to even have a shot at it. So not really forcing the awakening. Just handing them the opportunity. And if they fail they could lose WP dots and or go completely insane. So, think it's rather fair, personally.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, where is the errata on that? From my reading Radiance 5 is like Flesh 5 or Transformation 5 and you can transform your mortal to a pinnacle level with your awesome powers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147676#post1147676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Depends on the book, honestly there's alot of ones that say sorcerers are LESS likely to awaken than average persons thus why most characters don't start as such.<br /> <br /> Ultimately though Awakening is about leading the Horse to water. That's what your actions do, whether its training as a hermetic, or offering up a book that pushes people in that direction. Its ultimately up to the potential mage to Drink. I'd put the roll on the potential mage's end and make it more difficult the more times its tried. So your failed Hermetics would already be down some having failed once.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Edit: I'm pretty sure nearly ALL Hermetics start as sorcerers who work there way up to Awakened. If memory serves, not going through that standard training program is a social Flaw. Where has it ever been written that being a sorcerer makes you less likely to be Awakened compared to the billions of vanilla humans who have never even seen magic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 10-07-2017, 02:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T00:01:17-07:00","id":1147696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147682#post1147682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: I'm pretty sure nearly ALL Hermetics start as sorcerers who work there way up to Awakened. If memory serves, not going through that standard training program is a social Flaw. Where has it ever been written that being a sorcerer makes you less likely to be Awakened compared to the billions of vanilla humans who have never even seen magic?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorcerer, Ascensions Right hand. The fact that sorcerers have to take a merit to awaken in play?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T08:45:36-07:00","id":1147781,"title":"","content":"Ha, practically the only Mage book I've never read. I'll look it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T15:36:13-07:00","id":1147875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147696#post1147696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sorcerer, Ascensions Right hand. The fact that sorcerers have to take a merit to awaken in play?</div> </div> </div> </div>2e book. Sorcerer Revised says otherwise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T15:43:05-07:00","id":1147877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theoutlander523</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147875#post1147875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2e book. Sorcerer Revised says otherwise.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, wasn't it even mentioned you use your Avatar's resonance to flavor spells and that you are at least partially using your Avatar for sorcery? The Order of Hermes book refers to sorcerers as being half way to the Path of Gold.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 10-07-2017, 06:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T21:50:44-07:00","id":1147924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147877#post1147877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, wasn't it even mentioned you use your Avatar's resonance to flavor spells and that you are at least partially using your Avatar for sorcery? The Order of Hermes book refers to sorcerers as being half way to the Path of Gold.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am saying the books go back and forth whether being a hedge mage makes you more open to the idea or less. The Order of Hermes seems to have a good method of doing so, but that might be a property of the Hermetic Paradigm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T22:19:38-07:00","id":1148526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147924#post1147924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I am saying the books go back and forth whether being a hedge mage makes you more open to the idea or less. The Order of Hermes seems to have a good method of doing so, but that might be a property of the Hermetic Paradigm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T05:21:57-07:00","id":1148556,"title":"","content":"It makes some sense for sorcerers to have more difficulty awakening. A lot of awakenings are essentially the explosion of a pent-up feeling of &quot;there must be more to this&quot;. A sorcerer has an answer, and a strict path to faux enlightenment. It's a bit of a trap. Of course, a paradigm that, in it's apex, has actual awakening (see Hermetic apprentices post theurgy) would save the sorcerer from this, if they had any potential to awaken in the first place. <b>However,</b> keep in mind that sorcerers are the only people who can actually take a merit and awaken - as in, the only ones who can sort of choose to - it's just that their illusions are more elaborate, so most think they have already seen <i>beyond the veil</i> so to speak. Hell, a lot of mages can't tell sorcerers apart from the true awakened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12911-lateral-psychotropy","name":"Lateral.Psychotropy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T05:10:53-07:00","id":1148790,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Mercurial;n1147682]<br /> <br /> Wait, where is the errata on that? From my reading Radiance 5 is like Flesh 5 or Transformation 5 and you can transform your mortal to a pinnacle level with your awesome powers.<br /> <br /> /QUOTE]<br /> <br /> Huh... Upon rereading it apparently doesn't explicitly say it can only be used once every few years. Apparently just a universal house rule everyone I game with uses based on the phrasing &quot;If successful, the target gains a permanent point of Willpower, having faced the worst aspects of her identity and accepted them.&quot; Seeing your own darkest aspects should lose the shock value after the first time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T08:10:27-07:00","id":1148823,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=angryicecream;n1148790]<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147682#post1147682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait, where is the errata on that? From my reading Radiance 5 is like Flesh 5 or Transformation 5 and you can transform your mortal to a pinnacle level with your awesome powers.<br /> <br /> /QUOTE]<br /> <br /> Huh... Upon rereading it apparently doesn't explicitly say it can only be used once every few years. Apparently just a universal house rule everyone I game with uses based on the phrasing &amp;quot;If successful, the target gains a permanent point of Willpower, having faced the worst aspects of her identity and accepted them.&amp;quot; Seeing your own darkest aspects should lose the shock value after the first time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless there are more perspectives of your own soul to witness. I suspect there is always something more to see, or something that can be expanded upon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T22:40:57-07:00","id":1149000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lateral.Psychotropy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1148556#post1148556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It makes some sense for sorcerers to have more difficulty awakening. A lot of awakenings are essentially the explosion of a pent-up feeling of &quot;there must be more to this&quot;. A sorcerer has an answer, and a strict path to faux enlightenment. It's a bit of a trap. Of course, a paradigm that, in it's apex, has actual awakening (see Hermetic apprentices post theurgy) would save the sorcerer from this, if they had any potential to awaken in the first place. <b>However,</b> keep in mind that sorcerers are the only people who can actually take a merit and awaken - as in, the only ones who can sort of choose to - it's just that their illusions are more elaborate, so most think they have already seen <i>beyond the veil</i> so to speak. Hell, a lot of mages can't tell sorcerers apart from the true awakened.</div> </div> </div> </div>It also depends on the sorcerer interpretation your using. If you're using revised sorcerer where they're just semi-awakened mortals(and only that book) then yes. If you also add other splat interpretations(like demon hunter x, hunters hunted, etc.) sorcerer revised becomes just mages narrow view of what sorcerers are(or at least I think so, WOD books are always written from the perspective of an in universe character after all.).<br /> <br /> I personally like to think they're more than mage ghoul/kinfolk equivalents(they have different powers and mechanics after all), and as such run it like gifts or blood magic where paradigms are a non-factor and paths are just normal rules in reality. That might not work for every one though and it's just as valid to use other read books while keeping the mini-mage interpretation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T09:55:27-07:00","id":1149714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1147877#post1147877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, wasn't it even mentioned you use your Avatar's resonance to flavor spells and that you are at least partially using your Avatar for sorcery? The Order of Hermes book refers to sorcerers as being half way to the Path of Gold.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wouldn't make much sense since you can lack a soul and still do Sorcery. Prometheans and vat borns are used by Mages as assistants all the time.<br /> Sorcery is just supposed to be innate laws of magic built into the universe, that just require will to get them going.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T16:02:25-07:00","id":1149782,"title":"","content":"Maybe it\u2019s because if you are a human you can\u2019t use magic without stirring your Avatar to wakefulness? If you are reaching out with your will in a supernatural way, your Avatar is finally able to stir a little and even has a tiny outlet to manifest itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T16:26:10-07:00","id":1149786,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Mercurial;n1148823]<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angryicecream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1148790#post1148790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unless there are more perspectives of your own soul to witness. I suspect there is always something more to see, or something that can be expanded upon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh the power allready strips away all the deception. A revelation has to be meaningful, otherwise its no revelation. Doesn't sound like a power that can be spammed to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T20:03:07-07:00","id":1149832,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Flinty;n1149786]<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1148823#post1148823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh the power allready strips away all the deception. A revelation has to be meaningful, otherwise its no revelation. Doesn't sound like a power that can be spammed to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe not, but having to overcome something that you find traumatic can fill you with a growing sense of strength every time you stand up to it. Plus, I do feel it\u2019s appropriate for Angels of your soul\u2019s illumination to be able to able to remold you on much the same level as Angels of the Flesh, Transformation, and Spirit. It would REALLY undermine them if this Lore\u2019s capstone power was a one dot wonder and for the most part was limited to once every few years while everyone else can use their powers to rebuild humans into prime specimens of humanity in a matter of days at most.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 10-14-2017, 11:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T02:35:47-07:00","id":1149884,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Mercurial;n1149832]<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flinty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1146909-demons-and-awakenings?p=1149786#post1149786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe not, but having to overcome something that you find traumatic can fill you with a growing sense of strength every time you stand up to it. Plus, I do feel it\u2019s appropriate for Angels of your soul\u2019s illumination to be able to able to remold you on much the same level as Angels of the Flesh, Transformation, and Spirit. It would REALLY undermine them if this Lore\u2019s capstone power was a one dot wonder and for the most part was limited to once every few years while everyone else can use their powers to rebuild humans into prime specimens of humanity in a matter of days at most.</div> </div> </div> </div>The point is that Revelation isn't a &quot;buff minion&quot; power. Radiance allready has that in exalt (and boy is exalt powerful), Revelation is more about the actual revelation, the wp point is more icing on the cake. For one everyone that has been granted a revelation by you will have a very hard time not thinking of you of a very glorious divine being. On the other hand while they are in revelation mode they are basically putty in your hands if you win the roll and will reveal everything.<br /> <br /> You can use revelation multiple times, personally I just wouldn't let the wp gain stack. In the end I guess its up to the STs interpretation. Demon usually needs alot of houseruling, the corerules had alot of kinks, imo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}